#: simcontrols.js:54
msgid ""
"The yellow particles of sulphur and iron filings can be clearly seen and "
"they </br>are non-uniformly distributed throughout the mixture. This "
"indicates that </br>the mixture of iron and sulphur is heterogeneous in "
"appearance."
msgstr ""
"The yellow particles of sulphur and iron filings can be clearly seen and "
"they </br>are non-uniformly distributed throughout the mixture. This "
"indicates that </br>the mixture of iron and sulphur is heterogeneous in "
"appearance."

#: simcontrols.js:54
msgid ""
"Uniform grey-black particles can be seen throughout, indicating </br>that "
"the compound FeS is homogeneous in appearance."
msgstr ""
"Uniform grey-black particles can be seen throughout, indicating </br>that "
"the compound FeS is homogeneous in appearance."

#: simcontrols.js:54
msgid ""
"The iron filings cling to the magnet indicating that the iron has retained "
"its </br>original property (magnetic nature) during the formation of the "
"mixture."
msgstr ""
"The iron filings cling to the magnet indicating that the iron has retained "
"its </br>original property (magnetic nature) during the formation of the "
"mixture."

#: simcontrols.js:54
msgid ""
"There are no particles clinging to the magnet, indicating that iron has lost "
"its </br>original property (magnetic nature) on the formation of the "
"compound."
msgstr ""
"There are no particles clinging to the magnet, indicating that iron has lost "
"its </br>original property (magnetic nature) on the formation of the "
"compound."

#: simcontrols.js:54
msgid ""
"The yellow particles of sulphur dissolve in carbon disulphide to form a </"
"br>yellow solution, and the particles of iron settle at the bottom of the "
"test tube."
msgstr ""
"The yellow particles of sulphur dissolve in carbon disulphide to form a </"
"br>yellow solution, and the particles of iron settle at the bottom of the "
"test tube."

#: simcontrols.js:54
msgid ""
"On the evaporation of carbon disulphide, the yellow particles of </"
"br>sulphur reappear.This indicates that sulphur retains its </br>original "
"property during the formation of a mixture."
msgstr ""
"On the evaporation of carbon disulphide, the yellow particles of </"
"br>sulphur reappear.This indicates that sulphur retains its </br>original "
"property during the formation of a mixture."

#: simcontrols.js:54
msgid ""
"There is no change.This indicates that sulphur loses its </br>original "
"property on the formation of a compound."
msgstr ""
"There is no change.This indicates that sulphur loses its </br>original "
"property on the formation of a compound."

#: simcontrols.js:54
msgid ""
"A black mass forms and particles of iron and sulphur cannot be seen </"
"br>separately. Iron and sulphur, both lose their individual properties on </"
"br>heating, and react chemically to form a compound FeS."
msgstr ""
"A black mass forms and particles of iron and sulphur cannot be seen </"
"br>separately. Iron and sulphur, both lose their individual properties on </"
"br>heating, and react chemically to form a compound FeS."

#: simcontrols.js:54
msgid ""
"No change is observed.  The compound FeS does not undergo a </br>chemical "
"reaction when heated, nor does it lose its properties."
msgstr ""
"No change is observed.  The compound FeS does not undergo a </br>chemical "
"reaction when heated, nor does it lose its properties."

#: simcontrols.js:54
msgid ""
"Iron filings in the mixture reacts with dil.HCl producing</br> hydrogen gas "
"that extinguishes the burning matchstick with a</br> mild explosion while "
"producing a popping sound."
msgstr ""
"Iron filings in the mixture reacts with dil.HCl producing</br> hydrogen gas "
"that extinguishes the burning matchstick with a</br> mild explosion while "
"producing a popping sound."

#: simcontrols.js:54
msgid ""
"The compound FeS reacts with dil.HCl to produce </br>H<sub>2</sub>S gas "
"which reacts with copper sulphate solution </br>to form a black precipitate "
"of copper sulphide."
msgstr ""
"The compound FeS reacts with dil.HCl to produce </br>H<sub>2</sub>S gas "
"which reacts with copper sulphate solution </br>to form a black precipitate "
"of copper sulphide."

#: simcontrols.js:56
msgid "Click on the rod to stir the mixture."
msgstr "Click on the rod to stir the mixture."

#: simcontrols.js:56
msgid "Click on the rod to stir the compound."
msgstr "Click on the rod to stir the compound."

#: simcontrols.js:56
msgid "Drag the magnet towards the mixture."
msgstr "Drag the magnet towards the mixture."

#: simcontrols.js:56
msgid "Drag the magnet towards the compound."
msgstr "Drag the magnet towards the compound."

#: simcontrols.js:56
msgid ""
"Drag the dropper towards the test tube to </br>pour carbon disulphide into "
"the test tube."
msgstr ""
"Drag the dropper towards the test tube to </br>pour carbon disulphide into "
"the test tube."

#: simcontrols.js:56
msgid ""
"Click on the test tube containing the mixture </br>and solution to shake it "
"well. Drag the test </br>tube to pour the solution into the china dish </"
"br>and wait for two mins."
msgstr ""
"Click on the test tube containing the mixture </br>and solution to shake it "
"well. Drag the test tube towards the </br>petri dish to pour the solution  "
"into it and wait for two minutes."

#: simcontrols.js:56
msgid ""
"Click on the test tube containing the </br>compound and solution to shake it "
"well."
msgstr ""
"Click on the test tube containing the </br>compound and solution to shake it "
"well."

#: simcontrols.js:56
msgid "Click on the bent tube to remove it."
msgstr "Click on the bent tube to remove it."

#: simcontrols.js:56
msgid ""
"Drag the matchstick towards the mouth of the </br>test tube that is on the "
"test tube rack."
msgstr ""
"Drag the matchstick towards the mouth of the </br>test tube that is on the "
"test tube rack."

#: simcontrols.js:58
msgid "Select the test."
msgstr "Select the test."

#: simcontrols.js:58
msgid "Select the sample of Fe and S."
msgstr "Select the sample."
